  "description": "2-tier variant of Application Analytics for apps with no scrapable host (vendor-hosted infra) and no backend database -- Layer 1 (Golden Signals) and Layer 3 (Application) only. See 2-tier-fullstack-analytics for the full app+host+db dashboard.",
