          "description": "Granular view for the selected endpoint.\n\nShows error count, total request rate and p95 latency for this single operation. Use the time range picker to zoom into the incident window.\n\n**For deeper log investigation** connect Grafana Loki or Elasticsearch and filter by `app=$app route=$route status_code=~[45]..`",
